# 1. Overview
The BAKE4U Tracking System provides customers with real-time insights into their order delivery progress.  
It integrates the driver GPS tracking system with order statuses, distance estimation, and map visualization.

Components involved:
- Customer tracking UI  
- Order status endpoint  
- Driver last known location  
- Haversine distance calculation  
- JSON API responses  
- Map rendering via Leaflet 

---

# 2. Tracking Architecture

```txt
Customer Browser
        │
        ▼
GET /customer/---/--------.php
        │
        ▼
+---------------------+
| Orders Table        |
| Deliveries Table    |
| Driver Locations    |
+---------------------+
```

Each request returns:
- Order details  
- Delivery status  
- Driver location  
- Distance from driver → customer  

