# 5. Driver Last Known Coordinates

Fetched using:

```sql
SELECT driver_, gps_latitude, gps_longitude, recorded_at
FROM -----_---
WHERE driver_-- = ?
ORDER BY recorded_at DESC
LIMIT 1;
```

Returned to customers as:
```json
{
  "lat": -26.12,
  "lng": 28.06
}
```

