# 6. Real-Time Status Updates

The customer UI automatically polls the API every **5–10 seconds**:

```js
setInterval(() => {
    fetch(`/customer/---/-------${--}`)
      .then(res => res.json())
      .then(updateUI);
}, 5000);
```

Updates include:
- Order status  
- Driver distance  
- Driver movements  
- Delivery ETA (future feature)

